# 67. How would you handle an LLM provider outage?

Design resilience.

### Retry

Use exponential backoff for transient failures.

### Timeout

Don't let requests hang indefinitely.

### Circuit breaker

Stop hammering an unhealthy provider.

### Fallback model/provider

```text
Primary model
      ↓ failure
Secondary model
```

### Graceful degradation

Maybe retrieval search still works even when generation doesn't.

### Queuing

For asynchronous workloads.

Important:

Test fallback behavior before the outage.

